{"3516220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Squawky", "steam_appid": 3516220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where a rubber chicken is your flashlight. Enhance it with strange energies to progress, survive twisted enemies, and whatever you do, don’t let Squawky catch you.  <br><br><strong><u>ANNA (Player Character)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a 9-year-old child who gets lost in a cornfield and ends up at the residence of the owners of Sunshine Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SUNSHINE FARMS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunshine Farms is going out of business. They were known for hosting pumpkin patch events, growing corn, and manufacturing rubber Squawky chicken toys. They also created the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine, which can modify your rubber chicken toy by adding various energies such as light, fire, water, electricity, and earth.<br><br><strong><u>SQUAWKY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squawky is a lab experiment gone wrong. Its creators took advantage of the failed experiment and began profiting from people's curiosity to see Squawky. As a result, Squawky became increasingly hostile toward people and ultimately caused Sunshine Farms to go bankrupt. DON’T GET CAUGHT BY SQUAWKY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RUBBER CHICKEN TOY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.poster.avif?t=1763564937\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.webm?t=1763564937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.mp4?t=1763564937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rubber chicken lights up when squeezed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.poster.avif?t=1763564937\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.webm?t=1763564937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.mp4?t=1763564937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your rubber chicken with different energies by using the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where a rubber chicken is your flashlight. Enhance it with strange energies to progress, survive twisted enemies, and whatever you do, don’t let Squawky catch you.  <br><br><strong><u>ANNA (Player Character)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a 9-year-old child who gets lost in a cornfield and ends up at the residence of the owners of Sunshine Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SUNSHINE FARMS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunshine Farms is going out of business. They were known for hosting pumpkin patch events, growing corn, and manufacturing rubber Squawky chicken toys. They also created the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine, which can modify your rubber chicken toy by adding various energies such as light, fire, water, electricity, and earth.<br><br><strong><u>SQUAWKY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_pa